  "citation": "Johnson K M; Wallace D W R; Wilke R J; Goyet C (1996): CO2, Hydrographic, and Chemical Data Obtained During the R/V Meteor Cruise 15/3 in the South Atlantic Ocean (WOCE Section A9, February March 1991). CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/OTG.NDP051",
